          "title": "Seventeen to nineteen",
          "body": "**dix-sept**, **dix-huit** and **dix-neuf** mean *ten and seven*, *ten and eight*, *ten and nine*. The hyphen joins the two parts. **Vingt** is *twenty*, and it is the last word of this lesson.",
